  "description": "The TriHauler Terra Dual Drive T5 is a heavy-duty fat tire electric tricycle for adults with two 750W Bafang motors, torque-sensing pedal assist and a 550 lb total payload. Choose Black or White with a single 20Ah battery or dual 40Ah batteries. A low-step frame, upright riding position, front suspension and front and rear baskets support everyday errands, cargo trips and outdoor riding. Hydraulic disc brakes, parking locks, reverse and cruise control add ways to manage your ride.\nDual drive: one front-hub motor and one rear-drive motor, 1,500W combined continuous-rated power.\nBattery options: one 48V 20Ah battery (960Wh), or two 48V 20Ah batteries totaling 40Ah (1,920Wh).\nFat tires: 24 × 4-inch front and 20 × 4-inch rear Kenda tires with reflective sidewalls and puncture protection.\nPayload: 550 lb total, including the rider, cargo and added accessories. Front basket limit: 60 lb. Rear basket or rack limit: 220 lb. Individual limits apply within the total payload.\nFit and storage: recommended rider height 5'0\" (152 cm) and above; overall length 75 inches, overall width 30.7 inches and saddle-height adjustment 35–42 inches.",
